ENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3aCIpZgIeDwB1uQBAaPbKQ","review_id":"eDaGf6ddiq41iQd2fMV8Yg","date":"2019-09-29T13:06:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9459549784660339,"text_excerpt":"I came here the other day with my friends for breakfast and to do some work on our laptops. We all got the New Orleans style iced coffee, which was so smooth and delicious. It was the best coffee I've had in a long time and was the perfect amount of caffeine! For food, I got the biscuit sandwich with turkey, which melted in my mouth and was really flavorful. The only negative thing I'd say was there weren't any outlets in the place, so it's hard to sit and work all day, but it's definitely an excellent hang out spot besides that! I can't wait to come back on my next trip to New Orleans."},{"business_id":"3aCIpZgIeDwB1uQBAaPbKQ","review_id":"JZQXc-ps-pLuUVlfnxGVbA","date":"2018-05-08T00:17:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9425742626190186,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! From the ambience to the food/drink, everything's amazing. It's such a cute place to hang out at on a nice day. I love to come here for breakfast--they have great waffle options! And I also love their NOLA iced coffee that comes with milk and sugar. It's the perfect amount of sugar, not too much, not too little. It's tucked away in a neighborhood off of Napoleon, but you can't miss the bright yellow house that says French Truck Coffee!"},{"business_id":"3aCIpZgIeDwB1uQBAaPbKQ","review_id":"VukHQHiOdy4k99rvt0Rj6A","date":"2017-12-31T19:07:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9400926828384399,"text_excerpt":"I live right near French Truck and walk there fairly often. It's a cute coffee shop with dripped cold brew and nice little plates to eat. Food is in little portions but very tasty. The inside and sitting area outside has WiFi available so it's a nice place to study or get some work done. I usually get the egg sandwich on a croissant and the Nola brew, which is their lightly sweetened iced coffee. A little on the pricier side, but the overall experience makes it very pleasant."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3aCIpZgIeDwB1uQBAaPbKQ","photo_id":"At5CYyaJZjbiUiEmQ_YrNg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/At5CYyaJZjbiUiEmQ_YrNg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.887727677822113},{"business_id":"3aCIpZgIeDwB1uQBAaPbKQ","photo_id":"af7NLkf0jYJAf7nCMU9hjA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/af7NLkf0jYJAf7nCMU9hjA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8675263524055481},{"business_id":"3aCIpZgIeDwB1uQBAaPbKQ","photo_id":"BxN_z7MoKPTYF3scJCMwBQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/BxN_z7MoKPTYF3scJCMwBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8602678775787354},{"business_id":"3aCIpZgIeDwB1uQBAaPbKQ","photo_id":"_Uuvl9Dyk7ezspI1vWCqZQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_Uuvl9Dyk7ezspI1vWCqZQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.845668613910675},{"business_id":"3aCIpZgIeDwB1uQBAaPbKQ","photo_id":"WsIJXbGDLwtwW0M0mplINA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WsIJXbGDLwtwW0M0mplINA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8121674656867981}]},"notebook_case":null}
